    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}. The\n",
        "mythical stage built to show respect\f",
        "for ARCEUS.\r",
        "It is said that people used to\n",
        "celebrate its magnificent might with\f",
        "music and dance.\r",
        "Some people in Johto still pass down\n",
        "this tradition."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00002",
      "from": "scr_seq_D51R0201_001#11"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Bring your ARCEUS instead.\r",
        "Any other Pokémon may get blown away\n",
        "by the strong power lingering\f",
        "at the ruins.\r"
      ]
    },
