    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Of course... ARCEUS!\r",
        "So the source of the power I’ve felt\n",
        "was ARCEUS!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: What is now the {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins\n",
        "{COLOR 0}was built to honor ARCEUS by the\f",
        "Sinnoh people...\r",
        "It’s an icebound temple that has been\n",
        "waiting for ARCEUS for hundreds\f",
        "of years...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "It is designed to bring out the power\n",
        "ARCEUS possesses.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0146_D51R0201_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: ARCEUS is described in\n",
        "mythology as being the origin of\f",
        "everything and the source of\f",
        "all beings.\r",
        "It is said that the power of ARCEUS\n",
        "is released on the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
